  "description": "The text claims Facebook reviewed a report about a group advocating 'all jews should be burned alive' and found it doesn't violate their terms of service. The visual material shows a woman in a professional setting. The meme uses her image to imply she is associated with or complicit in this hate group, despite her calm demeanor and professional appearance. This is an analogical mapping where the woman (visual entity) is projected as the entity (or representative) of the hateful group (textual entity).",
